WEBVTT

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.060
This route should get us there faster.

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:08.400
Huh? But the inn is this way.

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:14.890
<i>Remain calm and listen, you three.</i>

00:00:14.890 --> 00:00:15.710
<i>Telepathy?</i>

00:00:15.710 --> 00:00:17.410
<i>What's the problem?</i>

00:00:17.770 --> 00:00:19.190
<i>We're being tailed.</i>

00:00:19.190 --> 00:00:20.210
<i>Tailed?</i>

00:00:20.210 --> 00:00:22.330
<i>That's why you suddenly changed routes?</i>

00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:25.340
<i>Most likely the lord's flunkies.</i>

00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:28.250
<i>I doubt they're here for a friendly greeting.</i>

00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:32.460
<i>Let's use a concealment spell 
and see what they do.</i>

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:35.260
<i>If it's clear they're hostile, 
we'll pull the rug out from under them.</i>

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:36.840
They disappeared!

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:39.350
Damn! Where'd they go?!

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:42.710
Excuse me, sir. 
We're a bit lost.

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:46.820
Could you tell us the way to the inn?

00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:48.290
S-Sure...

00:00:48.290 --> 00:00:50.730
Your inn should be down that way.

00:00:52.210 --> 00:00:54.990
So you know where we're staying?

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:56.660
Damn!

00:00:56.920 --> 00:00:57.810
Don't move!

00:00:57.810 --> 00:01:00.860
Do as we tell you 
if you don't wanna see him dead!

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:04.370
Oh, s-someone save me!

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:06.830
Matty...

00:01:06.830 --> 00:01:08.270
What a bad actor...

00:02:39.010 --> 00:02:44.010
<b>Episode 8</b>

00:02:39.570 --> 00:02:44.010
<b>The Strongest Sage Saves the City.</b>

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:46.170
Someone save me!

00:02:46.170 --> 00:02:48.140
C'mon! Pipe down!

00:02:48.140 --> 00:02:49.640
What do you want with us?

00:02:49.640 --> 00:02:52.250
I know who you people are.

00:02:52.250 --> 00:02:54.900
And that he's the weakest 
out of all of you!

00:02:56.070 --> 00:02:57.790
<i>Why would you assume that?</i>

00:02:57.790 --> 00:03:00.990
Because he's the party healer!

00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:07.950
<i>Ah, I guess word reached the lord 
about them handling the monster dispatch.</i>

00:03:07.950 --> 00:03:11.320
You'll be serving our lord now!

00:03:11.320 --> 00:03:12.920
Do as you're told, or die!

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:15.320
Iris, no weapons.

00:03:15.320 --> 00:03:16.920
Just knock them out, okay?

00:03:16.920 --> 00:03:18.240
Okay!

00:03:18.670 --> 00:03:20.420
Huh? This some kind of joke?

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:23.390
There's no way you can beat us unarmed!

00:03:25.660 --> 00:03:27.560
She's a beast!

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:31.380
Okay, now it's my turn!

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:37.730
Hold it! 
Don't you realize we have a hostage?!

00:03:37.730 --> 00:03:39.070
Last one!

00:03:41.920 --> 00:03:44.320
All right, they're out like a light.

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:45.590
All that's left...

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:49.250
You're casting a tracking spell?

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:52.320
Yes. And a demon-detecting one.

00:03:52.320 --> 00:03:55.830
I think there's a good chance 
they're in bed with demons.

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:03.530
Good morning, Matty!

00:04:03.530 --> 00:04:04.890
What's that?

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:07.380
The king's messenger delivered a letter.

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:09.350
We're heading out now.

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:13.240
I don't see anyone.

00:04:13.240 --> 00:04:16.850
Are you sure this is 
where we're supposed to meet?

00:04:16.850 --> 00:04:18.800
I know you're there.

00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:20.360
Come out, would you?

00:04:21.130 --> 00:04:24.410
I beg your pardon. 
My name is Eik.

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:32.830
I was told to hide, under the assumption 
that you would find me easily.

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:38.350
And you chose this for our meeting spot 
so that the lord wouldn't catch on?

00:04:38.350 --> 00:04:39.530
Yes.

00:04:39.530 --> 00:04:43.480
I bear His Majesty's response to your report

00:04:43.480 --> 00:04:47.030
regarding the lord's exploitation 
of Dungeon City Melkia.

00:04:47.030 --> 00:04:48.260
Tell me.

00:04:49.330 --> 00:04:53.320
"I hereby command that 
Lord Dokiel Melkia be taken into custody.

00:04:53.320 --> 00:04:56.250
If you desire to take him 
into custody yourselves,

00:04:56.250 --> 00:05:01.150
you have my permission to do so, 
under the supervision of Royal Proxy Eik."

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:03.610
That'll save us time. Thank you.

00:05:03.920 --> 00:05:06.250
You wish to arrest him yourselves, then?

00:05:06.250 --> 00:05:08.820
Yes. Are you three okay with that?

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:11.660
Yes! The dungeon city is 
in such an awful state!

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:14.540
We can't just let this go on!

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:16.290
I agree, too!

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:20.610
I cast a tracking spell 
on the lord's underlings.

00:05:20.610 --> 00:05:23.080
I know where he is.

00:05:23.080 --> 00:05:25.260
An estate on the edge of town.

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:28.630
But the estate is closely guarded.

00:05:28.630 --> 00:05:30.890
Shall I call for the knights' assistance?

00:05:30.890 --> 00:05:32.330
No need.

00:05:32.330 --> 00:05:34.310
We can handle it just fine 
on our own.

00:05:34.310 --> 00:05:35.770
Really?

00:05:35.770 --> 00:05:38.250
All right, let's get that lord!

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:39.770
Yeah!

00:05:42.740 --> 00:05:44.690
Something doesn't seem right here.

00:05:44.690 --> 00:05:45.660
Indeed.

00:05:45.660 --> 00:05:47.990
The gate's closed in the middle of the day.

00:05:47.990 --> 00:05:50.450
No sign of any guards, either.

00:05:52.470 --> 00:05:55.370
I'm sensing plenty 
of signatures within.

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:57.920
He must be concentrating his defenses.

00:05:58.270 --> 00:06:01.460
Do you think they've learned 
of our plans?

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:02.630
It appears likely.

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:03.830
It's not safe.

00:06:03.830 --> 00:06:05.760
We should turn back for now.

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:09.030
No, we'll plow 
right through the front gate.

00:06:09.030 --> 00:06:12.220
After the welcome they've prepared, 
it'd be rude not to...

00:06:14.300 --> 00:06:16.130
They came right to us!

00:06:16.130 --> 00:06:17.560
And just a five-man army at that!

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:18.890
Are they stupid?

00:06:18.890 --> 00:06:21.190
That reward's ours!

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:23.480
Leave this to me!

00:06:25.340 --> 00:06:26.620
She deflected all of 'em!

00:06:26.620 --> 00:06:28.280
A barrier spell?!

00:06:28.630 --> 00:06:29.880
Well done, Lurie.

00:06:29.880 --> 00:06:32.040
I can tell your casting's getting faster.

00:06:32.040 --> 00:06:33.190
Thank you!

00:06:33.190 --> 00:06:36.660
You can leave the rest to me!

00:06:41.420 --> 00:06:43.580
Dispatch successful.

00:06:43.580 --> 00:06:46.880
You took them all out 
with one strike?

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:49.720
I wanted to hit 'em good, too!

00:06:49.720 --> 00:06:53.240
I see now 
what His Majesty was referring to...

00:06:53.240 --> 00:06:56.340
When he said not to get 
on Sir Matthias's bad side.

00:06:57.730 --> 00:07:00.330
It appears the lord's room 
is on the second floor.

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:03.250
Passive Detect suggests 
there's no one on the second floor.

00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:04.480
The signatures are in the basement.

00:07:04.480 --> 00:07:08.690
But there's nothing about a basement 
in the blueprints.

00:07:11.040 --> 00:07:11.950
Here we are.

00:07:17.270 --> 00:07:18.660
Let's go.

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:24.850
It's grown quiet.

00:07:24.850 --> 00:07:27.290
Did they crush the intruders?

00:07:27.290 --> 00:07:30.270
If they had, 
we'd have heard about it.

00:07:30.270 --> 00:07:33.220
It's too quiet. 
Could something have...?

00:07:33.220 --> 00:07:37.260
They couldn't possibly defeat 
that many men so quickly.

00:07:37.650 --> 00:07:40.270
But in the interest of caution,

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:43.510
let's take the secret passage 
to the surface.

00:07:44.750 --> 00:07:46.500
You have a secret passage, eh?

00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:48.560
How prepared of you.

00:07:48.560 --> 00:07:50.620
Who in the world are you?

00:07:50.620 --> 00:07:53.080
Was there a child like this 
in the garrison?

00:07:53.080 --> 00:07:53.740
No...

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:57.200
You sent men to kill me 
without knowing what I looked like?

00:07:57.620 --> 00:08:01.250
Wait... 
Are you Matthias Hildesheimer?!

00:08:01.600 --> 00:08:03.930
Who else would I possibly be?

00:08:03.930 --> 00:08:06.880
How did you get here? 
Where are the others?!

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:09.480
Hey, guys! Come on in!

00:08:10.130 --> 00:08:11.640
You fool!

00:08:11.640 --> 00:08:15.320
You've strayed carelessly far 
from your female escort!

00:08:15.320 --> 00:08:16.260
"Escort"?

00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:18.310
Get him, men!

00:08:23.690 --> 00:08:25.310
H-How did you...

00:08:25.310 --> 00:08:27.310
I thought you were the party healer!

00:08:27.310 --> 00:08:30.210
I suppose he really did believe that.

00:08:30.210 --> 00:08:33.150
The truth should've been obvious 
from his gear.

00:08:33.150 --> 00:08:37.910
Dokiel Melkia, I hereby arrest you 
under orders from the king!

00:08:37.910 --> 00:08:38.970
What?!

00:08:38.970 --> 00:08:41.940
I am the Royal Proxy, 
and under my supervision,

00:08:41.940 --> 00:08:45.700
Sir Matthias has the authority 
to arrest you.

00:08:45.700 --> 00:08:48.950
I won't accept the authority 
of some child!

00:08:48.950 --> 00:08:50.670
Excuse me for being a child.

00:08:50.970 --> 00:08:52.530
You'll pay for this!

00:08:52.530 --> 00:08:58.510
Terrible things will befall this city 
if anything happens to me!

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:02.530
I just knocked him out.

00:09:02.530 --> 00:09:05.690
An interrogation might gain you 
some useful information,

00:09:05.690 --> 00:09:08.440
even from a blithering fool like this.

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:12.440
I will see him brought to His Majesty.

00:09:12.440 --> 00:09:13.780
Please do.

00:09:13.780 --> 00:09:15.900
We have a few other things to do.

00:09:15.900 --> 00:09:17.320
Like what?

00:09:17.320 --> 00:09:20.350
I want to find out 
how they anticipated our raid.

00:09:20.350 --> 00:09:21.350
That's right.

00:09:21.350 --> 00:09:24.660
How did they learn 
about the king's orders?

00:09:24.660 --> 00:09:26.620
Look at this.

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:28.330
A letter?

00:09:28.850 --> 00:09:31.090
It tells of the decision 
to have the lord arrested,

00:09:31.090 --> 00:09:34.010
and that an authorized executor 
would be arriving soon.

00:09:34.010 --> 00:09:35.970
Where did that come from?

00:09:36.900 --> 00:09:40.080
There are faint traces 
of magic on the letter.

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:42.720
It's clear there's a demon involved.

00:09:42.720 --> 00:09:44.100
Demon?!

00:09:44.100 --> 00:09:47.580
Were they using the lord 
to do something else?

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:51.190
Something involving the city's dungeon, 
most likely.

00:09:51.190 --> 00:09:53.940
Do you think 
they're after the magistones?

00:09:54.240 --> 00:09:55.530
No.

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:59.220
I think the demons are after the Dragon Vein 
in the dungeon.

00:09:59.610 --> 00:10:03.280
The Dragon Vein here is far bigger 
than the one in the capital.

00:10:03.280 --> 00:10:05.580
If infused with a spell,

00:10:05.870 --> 00:10:08.340
it could cause worldwide calamity.

00:10:09.390 --> 00:10:12.290
"Worldwide... calamity"?

00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:14.400
I must report to the capital at once!

00:10:14.400 --> 00:10:16.780
Please do. And hurry!

00:10:16.780 --> 00:10:18.090
Wait a minute!

00:10:18.090 --> 00:10:19.550
Do you hear something?

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:24.810
An attack?!

00:10:24.810 --> 00:10:25.970
No, an earthquake!

00:10:28.370 --> 00:10:30.850
The demons have already started tampering 
with Dragon Vein.

00:10:37.690 --> 00:10:38.780
Matty...

00:10:38.780 --> 00:10:40.030
This magical signature...

00:10:40.030 --> 00:10:42.610
Yeah, they've spawned a monster horde.

00:10:42.610 --> 00:10:43.740
It's heading our way!

00:10:45.050 --> 00:10:49.620
The demons' tampering with the Dragon Vein 
is calling the monsters here.

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:52.330
This is what the lord was talking about!

00:10:52.950 --> 00:10:56.550
We have to get the demons away 
from the Dragon Vein right away!

00:10:56.550 --> 00:10:58.030
But what about the monsters?

00:10:58.030 --> 00:11:01.100
All of Melkia will be in danger 
if we don't stop them!

00:11:01.100 --> 00:11:05.430
It'll be about two hours 
before the monster horde arrives at Melkia.

00:11:05.430 --> 00:11:07.300
Let's hurry to the dungeon.

00:11:07.300 --> 00:11:09.980
We'll have to finish this 
within two hours!

00:11:12.060 --> 00:11:14.480
I don't see any demons here.

00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:17.110
They must have moved to a lower floor.

00:11:17.110 --> 00:11:21.640
Maybe they realized we were coming 
and went to set a trap.

00:11:23.030 --> 00:11:25.450
Iris, can you start digging 
right around here?

00:11:25.450 --> 00:11:27.160
Sure thing!

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:37.710
This is the Dragon Vein that runs 
through this great dungeon.

00:11:37.710 --> 00:11:39.720
So much magical power...

00:11:39.720 --> 00:11:43.650
And it has a demonic air about it!

00:11:43.650 --> 00:11:44.800
Well detected.

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:46.010
What does it mean?

00:11:46.010 --> 00:11:50.630
It's probably something the demons rigged up 
in the Dragon Vein a long time ago.

00:11:50.630 --> 00:11:53.960
Now they're trying 
to put on the finishing touches.

00:11:53.960 --> 00:11:56.190
Can we stop... 
whatever it is they're doing?

00:11:56.190 --> 00:11:57.220
Yes.

00:11:57.220 --> 00:11:59.230
Let's split up into two teams.

00:11:59.230 --> 00:12:02.140
I'll head to the floor 
where the demons are hiding and strike.

00:12:02.140 --> 00:12:03.440
What will we do?

00:12:03.440 --> 00:12:06.530
Stop whatever they're trying to get the Dragon Vein 
to do and restore it to normal.

00:12:06.530 --> 00:12:08.200
W-Wait a minute!

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:09.370
Without you?

00:12:09.640 --> 00:12:12.190
Yeah. And you'll be taking point, Lurie.

00:12:12.190 --> 00:12:13.570
Don't sweat it, Lurie!

00:12:13.570 --> 00:12:14.800
I'm here for you!

00:12:14.800 --> 00:12:17.020
I'll keep you safe, too!

00:12:17.020 --> 00:12:19.630
V-Very well. I'll do my best.

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:23.170
I've rigged up the Dragon Vein 
with a communications casting circle.

00:12:23.170 --> 00:12:25.220
Its range isn't unlimited,

00:12:25.220 --> 00:12:28.430
but we should be able to communicate 
from anywhere in the dungeon.

00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:29.990
Now, let's begin the operation!

00:12:29.990 --> 00:12:31.520
Yeah!

00:12:32.870 --> 00:12:34.190
<i>Lurie, you hear me?</i>

00:12:34.190 --> 00:12:35.120
<i>Yes!</i>

00:12:35.120 --> 00:12:36.520
<i>How's the Dragon Vein looking?</i>

00:12:36.810 --> 00:12:38.780
<i>I've located the abnormal flow.</i>

00:12:38.780 --> 00:12:40.530
<i>I'm trying to restore it to normal!</i>

00:12:40.810 --> 00:12:44.740
<i>One wrong move when messing with a Dragon Vein 
could blow up the town.</i>

00:12:44.740 --> 00:12:46.290
<i>Make sure you go slow and steady!</i>

00:12:47.520 --> 00:12:48.620
I-I will!

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:52.950
<i>Only one hour 
until the monster horde arrives in Melkia.</i>

00:12:53.220 --> 00:12:55.020
<i>We don't have much time.</i>

00:12:55.020 --> 00:12:56.940
<i>I'm close to the demons.</i>

00:12:56.940 --> 00:12:59.500
<i>Lurie, let's keep communications clear 
for a little while.</i>

00:12:59.780 --> 00:13:01.960
<i>I will! Be careful!</i>

00:13:05.130 --> 00:13:06.950
Come on out.

00:13:06.950 --> 00:13:10.820
Are you the one interfering 
with my manipulation of the Dragon Vein?

00:13:10.820 --> 00:13:12.590
What if I am?

00:13:16.540 --> 00:13:18.520
<i>The slight fluctuations 
in his magical power...</i>

00:13:18.520 --> 00:13:20.890
<i>Is he using a communication spell?</i>

00:13:20.890 --> 00:13:22.730
<i>I'll use Magic Align to tap into it.</i>

00:13:23.500 --> 00:13:29.570
<i>Not even Matthias Hildesheimer could interfere 
with the Dragon Vein while on the move.</i>

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:32.480
<i>The interference is his colleague's doing.</i>

00:13:32.480 --> 00:13:36.250
<i>Her casting level is low, 
but she is skilled.</i>

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:41.090
<i>Destroy Matthias and finish off the one 
interfering with the Vein.</i>

00:13:41.090 --> 00:13:43.440
<i>And do not underestimate him.</i>

00:13:43.440 --> 00:13:44.760
<i>I won't.</i>

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:47.800
<i>I'll fight cautiously, as you instructed.</i>

00:13:48.060 --> 00:13:51.360
<i>So there's a big boss giving him orders?</i>

00:13:51.360 --> 00:13:55.450
<i>And he knows a lot about casting 
and Dragon Veins.</i>

00:13:55.450 --> 00:13:56.660
<i>Interesting.</i>

00:13:56.660 --> 00:14:00.180
<i>I might get a decent fight for once.</i>

00:14:10.520 --> 00:14:15.280
It seems the much-rumored Matthias Hildesheimer 
is still only human!

00:14:15.280 --> 00:14:19.080
You think you can defeat me 
with a trivial attack like that?

00:14:19.350 --> 00:14:22.990
<i>The kind of barrier 
that blows up when you attack.</i>

00:14:22.990 --> 00:14:25.000
<i>This'll be tricky.</i>

00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:28.400
<i>The barrier appears to be working.</i>

00:14:28.400 --> 00:14:29.190
<i>Yes, sir.</i>

00:14:29.190 --> 00:14:32.950
<i>Though the power of his attacks 
is greater than I imagined.</i>

00:14:32.950 --> 00:14:35.730
<i>Finish him before he breaches the barrier.</i>

00:14:35.730 --> 00:14:38.290
<i>A prolonged battle against a superior opponent 
will put you at a disadvantage.</i>

00:14:38.290 --> 00:14:39.520
<i>Yes, sir!</i>

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:41.120
<i>There's no question.</i>

00:14:41.120 --> 00:14:43.900
<i>They're tactics designed 
to fight a Crest of Failure.</i>

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:45.560
<i>To fight me specifically.</i>

00:14:45.560 --> 00:14:49.330
<i>This demon is more powerful 
than any I've faced before.</i>

00:14:49.330 --> 00:14:50.650
<i>Can you hear me, Lurie?</i>

00:14:50.650 --> 00:14:51.300
<i>Yes!</i>

00:14:51.300 --> 00:14:54.420
<i>Prepare casting circles 
fourteen and seventeen.</i>

00:14:54.420 --> 00:14:57.450
<i>Fourteen and seventeen? I will!</i>

00:14:57.450 --> 00:14:59.930
Matthias Hildesheimer.

00:14:59.930 --> 00:15:04.020
I've made all the preparations 
I need to deal with you.

00:15:04.020 --> 00:15:06.550
So let's have some fun!

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:08.500
See?

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:11.160
I know the Crest of Failure 
is best in close-combat!

00:15:11.160 --> 00:15:14.680
So I'll fight you at close-range, 
just as you want!

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:16.560
Or so I'll make it seem, until...

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:17.390
Take this!

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:19.460
Did I get him?!

00:15:19.460 --> 00:15:20.640
<i>Behind you.</i>

00:15:20.640 --> 00:15:22.100
One more time!

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:25.300
You seem a little desperate.

00:15:25.300 --> 00:15:27.580
One hit from that 
might just be the end of you.

00:15:27.580 --> 00:15:30.220
<i>If</i> you can land it.

00:15:30.220 --> 00:15:32.780
<i>The Crest of Failure is specialized 
for close combat.</i>

00:15:32.780 --> 00:15:36.470
<i>Continue attacking with ranged spells. 
Don't let him get close.</i>

00:15:36.470 --> 00:15:38.280
<i>I will!</i>

00:15:38.280 --> 00:15:41.200
<i>The demon giving the orders seems 
like a force to be reckoned with.</i>

00:15:41.200 --> 00:15:44.230
<i>The Crest of Failure countermeasures 
must have been his idea.</i>

00:15:44.770 --> 00:15:47.570
<i>I'd like to get a clue 
to his identity.</i>

00:15:47.570 --> 00:15:49.800
<i>Let's watch what happens 
a little while longer.</i>

00:15:49.800 --> 00:15:53.080
Guess that last attack wasn't quite enough.

00:15:53.080 --> 00:15:55.260
But what about this?!

00:15:55.560 --> 00:15:58.010
Using a series of magic attacks 
to close off my escape routes?!

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:09.360
Is that the last of it?

00:16:10.190 --> 00:16:12.250
<i>Matty! Are you all right?</i>

00:16:12.250 --> 00:16:15.910
<i>Yeah. I just dodged the demon's attack.</i>

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:18.770
<i>I'll need those spells in a bit. 
Are you ready?</i>

00:16:18.770 --> 00:16:20.500
<i>Yes! They're ready any time you need them!</i>

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:22.450
<i>I can't seem to hit him!</i>

00:16:22.450 --> 00:16:25.190
<i>His instinct for battle 
is greater than expected.</i>

00:16:25.190 --> 00:16:28.710
<i>Should I keep up the barrage 
until his magic runs out?</i>

00:16:29.010 --> 00:16:31.910
<i>No, it's dangerous 
to let this run too long.</i>

00:16:31.910 --> 00:16:35.330
<i>We'll have to move to Stage II 
sooner than expected.</i>

00:16:35.330 --> 00:16:37.100
<i>The trap, eh?</i>

00:16:37.100 --> 00:16:39.510
<i>A trap! 
Just what I've been waiting for!</i>

00:16:39.510 --> 00:16:42.250
<i>He's coming. Lure him into the trap!</i>

00:16:42.250 --> 00:16:43.480
<i>You got it!</i>

00:16:45.870 --> 00:16:48.520
<i>Lurie! 
Do you have those casting circles ready?</i>

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:50.030
<i>Yes! Ready any time!</i>

00:16:50.320 --> 00:16:53.210
<i>Great! 
Activate number fourteen first!</i>

00:16:53.210 --> 00:16:54.010
<i>Right!</i>

00:16:54.570 --> 00:16:59.580
<i>Spell fourteen will nullify the trap 
rigged up in the Dragon Vein.</i>

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:05.600
The trap didn't activate?! Why?!

00:17:05.600 --> 00:17:07.680
<i>Lurie! Now go with seventeen!</i>

00:17:07.680 --> 00:17:08.530
<i>Okay!</i>

00:17:08.530 --> 00:17:10.030
<i>The trap didn't activate!</i>

00:17:10.030 --> 00:17:11.660
<i>What now, sir?!</i>

00:17:11.660 --> 00:17:12.820
<i>Remain calm.</i>

00:17:14.650 --> 00:17:17.280
<i>Number seventeen is a spell 
using the Dragon Vein</i>

00:17:17.280 --> 00:17:19.200
<i>to disrupt communications in the area.</i>

00:17:19.200 --> 00:17:22.210
<i>In other words, 
it will block his communication spell.</i>

00:17:22.210 --> 00:17:24.370
Dammit! What's going on?

00:17:24.370 --> 00:17:25.880
Something the matter?

00:17:26.550 --> 00:17:29.770
But I still have my barrier. 
You can't harm me!

00:17:29.770 --> 00:17:31.110
Shall we test that hypothesis?

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:33.280
Fool!

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:38.060
<i>It deflects all my attacks. But...</i>

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:45.980
It'll never work! 
Your attacks won't get through!

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:48.580
What?!

00:17:50.330 --> 00:17:51.880
Why didn't it deflect that?

00:17:51.880 --> 00:17:54.690
The barrier was a good idea.

00:17:54.690 --> 00:17:57.230
But you didn't choose the right one.

00:17:57.230 --> 00:18:01.350
This barrier defends you 
by causing attacks to explode.

00:18:01.350 --> 00:18:05.790
Once it's activated, it takes at least half a second 
for the next one to get through.

00:18:06.910 --> 00:18:11.670
So if I attack in the split-second 
after it detonates the first attack,

00:18:11.670 --> 00:18:13.610
I can keep it from activating!

00:18:17.520 --> 00:18:18.700
You beast!

00:18:18.700 --> 00:18:21.030
No, still only human.

00:18:21.940 --> 00:18:23.950
<i>Can you hear me? What's happening?</i>

00:18:23.950 --> 00:18:25.910
<i>He destroyed my barrier!</i>

00:18:25.910 --> 00:18:27.430
<i>What?</i>

00:18:27.430 --> 00:18:32.250
<i>Could Matthias Hildesheimer really be 
the reincarnation of Gaius?!</i>

00:18:32.250 --> 00:18:35.460
<i>Is that rumor going around? 
Good instincts...</i>

00:18:35.890 --> 00:18:37.120
<i>Impossible.</i>

00:18:37.590 --> 00:18:40.310
<i>Gaius is one of the ancient humans.</i>

00:18:40.310 --> 00:18:45.680
<i>If that were Gaius, 
you'd already be dead.</i>

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:50.140
<i>The demon giving the orders 
knows about my past life?</i>

00:18:50.140 --> 00:18:52.900
<i>He must be a pretty old demon.</i>

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:55.020
It's time for your last resort.

00:18:55.020 --> 00:18:56.610
Use Disfortune.

00:19:00.450 --> 00:19:02.900
I'll finish this!

00:19:09.190 --> 00:19:10.560
Quit squirming!

00:19:10.560 --> 00:19:13.650
What's wrong? 
Weren't you going to finish this?

00:19:14.200 --> 00:19:18.850
Impossible! 
How can you dodge so many attacks?!

00:19:19.630 --> 00:19:23.090
I'm not anticipating them, 
if that's what you're thinking.

00:19:23.090 --> 00:19:25.050
I'm just simultaneously casting spells

00:19:25.050 --> 00:19:27.350
to deal with every attack 
I can imagine you sending,

00:19:27.350 --> 00:19:29.760
then scrapping the ones I don't need!

00:19:29.760 --> 00:19:30.730
What?!

00:19:30.730 --> 00:19:33.190
The spell-control potential granted 
by the Crest of Failure

00:19:33.450 --> 00:19:37.460
lets me cast four or five spells 
at once, easily.

00:19:38.210 --> 00:19:39.840
I will end this now!

00:19:41.740 --> 00:19:42.940
<i>Dodge it.</i>

00:19:42.940 --> 00:19:44.280
You won't be able to!

00:19:49.680 --> 00:19:50.990
Impossible!

00:19:50.990 --> 00:19:55.080
I cannot be defeated by a mere human!

00:20:04.470 --> 00:20:06.140
Dispatch successful.

00:20:06.840 --> 00:20:09.350
Lurie, I defeated the demon!

00:20:09.350 --> 00:20:10.700
Of course you did!

00:20:10.700 --> 00:20:15.300
I knew you'd win, Matty, 
but I didn't think it would be this fast!

00:20:15.300 --> 00:20:16.900
Yeah!

00:20:17.200 --> 00:20:20.110
<i>The monsters heading for Melkia 
are disappearing.</i>

00:20:20.110 --> 00:20:21.530
Really?

00:20:21.530 --> 00:20:24.370
<i>It's because you restored 
the Dragon Vein, Lurie.</i>

00:20:24.370 --> 00:20:25.740
<i>Well done.</i>

00:20:25.740 --> 00:20:27.470
<i>Are Alma and Iris safe, too?</i>

00:20:27.470 --> 00:20:28.330
Yes!

00:20:28.330 --> 00:20:30.330
We beat all the monsters!

00:20:30.330 --> 00:20:32.540
Wish it weren't over so quickly...

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:37.010
Now there's just one thing left undone.

00:20:37.010 --> 00:20:40.760
<i>Find the monster 
that was giving the orders?</i>

00:20:40.760 --> 00:20:42.100
Exactly.

00:20:42.100 --> 00:20:43.920
I'll pin down his magical signature.

00:20:43.920 --> 00:20:46.090
Get the disrupted Vein in order.

00:20:46.090 --> 00:20:47.520
<i>I will!</i>

00:20:48.620 --> 00:20:50.270
<i>You won't be able to trace me back.</i>

00:20:51.060 --> 00:20:55.470
<i>He was tapping my communication spell 
with Lurie?</i>

00:20:55.470 --> 00:20:58.180
<i>Matthias Hildesheimer.</i>

00:20:58.180 --> 00:21:00.430
<i>Do you know where I am?</i>

00:21:01.920 --> 00:21:06.660
<i>The magic is coming from a place 
several dozen kilometers away.</i>

00:21:06.660 --> 00:21:10.510
<i>I believe there's a town called Elenia 
in the area.</i>

00:21:11.060 --> 00:21:13.200
<i>But that's just a decoy.</i>

00:21:13.690 --> 00:21:14.950
I don't know.

00:21:14.950 --> 00:21:17.440
I just know you're not in Elenia.

00:21:17.440 --> 00:21:19.390
<i>A pity.</i>

00:21:19.390 --> 00:21:22.300
<i>I would have loved 
to deceive you about that.</i>

00:21:22.800 --> 00:21:24.850
We'll be fighting soon enough.

00:21:24.850 --> 00:21:26.760
I'm sure you're trembling 
in anticipation.

00:21:26.760 --> 00:21:30.600
I can't imagine 
why I'd ever want to fight you.

00:21:30.600 --> 00:21:32.270
But I definitely want to fight you.

00:21:32.270 --> 00:21:34.930
So you'd better start cooking up 
some countermeasures.

00:21:34.930 --> 00:21:39.150
You'll have to find me first.

00:21:40.460 --> 00:21:42.100
The communication's cut off.

00:21:42.560 --> 00:21:45.150
He must have destroyed the relay 
in Elenia.

00:21:46.140 --> 00:21:49.430
He's definitely on another level 
from previous enemies.

00:21:49.940 --> 00:21:53.820
About time I got something 
I could sink my teeth into.

00:23:26.290 --> 00:23:27.480
If I may, Iris.

00:23:27.480 --> 00:23:28.410
What is it?

00:23:28.410 --> 00:23:32.330
Can you take a form 
that's half-human and half-dragon?

00:23:32.330 --> 00:23:33.940
I'll try!

00:23:36.970 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Episode 9 
The Strongest Sage Duels.</b>

00:23:37.290 --> 00:23:39.930
I think I strained myself!
